@startuml Collaboration_Diagram
title Two-Way Sign Language Translator - Collaboration Diagram\n(Communication Between Objects)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam component {
    BackgroundColor #F5F8FF
    BorderColor #2563EB
    FontColor #1E293B
}
skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
    BorderColor #1E40AF
    FontColor #1E293B
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FEF9C3
    BorderColor #CA8A04
    FontColor #1E293B
}
skinparam title {
    FontColor #1E293B
    FontSize 16
}
skinparam ArrowColor #2563EB
skinparam shadowing false

component "TwoWayTranslatorApp\n(Main Controller)" as App
component "HandDetector hd [Primary]" as HD1
component "HandDetector hd2 [Cropped]" as HD2
component "CNN Model (cnn8grps_rad1_model.h5)" as CNN
component "Enchant Dict [en-US]" as Dict
component "pyttsx3 TTS Engine" as TTS
component "ASLImageGenerator" as ImgGen
component "SpeechRecognizer [Google API]" as SR
component "Tkinter GUI" as GUI
component "VideoCapture [Webcam]" as Camera

actor "Deaf User (Signing)" as DeafUser
actor "Hearing User (Speaking)" as HearingUser

DeafUser --> Camera : 1. hand gesture input
Camera --> App : 2. read(frame)
App --> HD1 : 3. findHands(frame)
HD1 --> App : 4. hand bbox + landmarks
App --> HD2 : 5. findHands(cropped_roi)
HD2 --> App : 6. pts[0..20]
App --> CNN : 7. predict(white_skeleton)
CNN --> App : 8. prob[8 groups]
App --> App : 9. apply_rules() -> letter
App --> Dict : 10. suggest(word)
Dict --> App : 11. [word1..word4]
App --> GUI : 12. update displays
App --> TTS : 13. say(sentence)

HearingUser --> SR : A. speak or type
SR --> App : B. recognized text
App --> ImgGen : C. create_asl_image(letter)
ImgGen --> App : D. PIL Image
App --> GUI : E. animate_next(image)

note right of CNN : 8 groups to 26 letters\nvia landmark geometry rules
note bottom of SR : Google Speech Recognition API\nInternet connection required
note top of ImgGen : Local PIL image generation\nwith caching in ./asl_images/

@enduml
